; In Late WaveTransform, temporal divergence of an i1 used outside a cycle needs no
; explicit lowering. The i1 reaches an LCSSA phi that AMDGPUGlobalISelDivergence-
; Lowering widens to an s32 value carried through the cycle in a vgpr (via
; G_SELECT), with the i1 rematerialized by G_ICMP. No lane-mask (sreg_32) i1 phi
; must survive.

; A divergent i1 phi used outside the loop.
define void @divergent_i1_phi_used_outside_loop(float %val, float %pre.cond.val, ptr %addr) {
